      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose is well above the usual limits for ibuprofen.\n\n- **Requested:** 1600 mg PO four times daily, which is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** The usual maximum is 800 mg per dose.\n- **Daily total:** The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under physician supervision. For OTC use it is 1,200 mg/day. The requested total is double the supervised maximum.\n- **Risks:** At this dose, the risks of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events rise sharply. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove those risks.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013800 mg PO every 6\u20138 hours** for pain or fever.\n- **1600 mg total daily**, for example 400 mg four times daily.\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and I'll enter it with a note recording that it's intentional. Otherwise, give me the dose you want and I'll enter it right away."
      }
